{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:36 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:36 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:36 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"警夥入境處大埔上水掃黃 12內地女被捕介乎26至52歲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ed2d2ffecbbb4674cd84f131ea91b7c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_18_45_48.jpg\"/><p>大埔警區特別職務隊聯同入境處人員根據線報及經深入調查後，今日（10月28日）下午在大埔及上水打擊非法賣淫，分別於同茂坊、大榮里、新發街及聯發街的唐樓單位內，共拘捕12名內地女子（26至52歲），涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><img alt=\"所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82142cd733539da1b2ea4aeae5214d33/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_18_45_40.jpg\" title=\"所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。\"/><p>所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:01:08.567152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:36:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:18:51.710605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:36.601653+00:00","content_hash":"265d831f4be94380db83b5a105f9ba81404d5d3ac0649a28f996003e0bdb0e77","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}